 in this country recently  well i can tell you we weren't going to  have the for the final numbers for 2020  yet uh for for another few weeks  but if you look at new home bill new  home builds new home starts  if you look at home sales prices going  up  i mean it's pretty clear that people are  viewing florida as a landing pad  you know tucker it's interesting as this  went on i would encounter people  particularly in september  that would move from parts of the  country say look they closed our schools  i want your schools are open i'm going  to come here because you guys are doing  it right  so i think there's been a variety of  factors taxes has been one thing tucker  but i really do think these lockdowns  have driven some people to florida  who just had enough with these draconian  ineffective restrictions  they think you're going to be the  republican nominee that's why they're  attacking you  i'm not going to ask you to respond to  that i know it's an uncomfortable  observation but i think that's what's  really going on tucker i can tell you  i'm pretty confident i'll be the  governor nominee in 2022 here in florida  so  you know we look forward to running that  race good to see you tonight thank you  thanks

